---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Alvalog" currentPath="/about">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="about-header">
      <h1 class="about-title">About</h1>
      <p class="about-lead">A journal on technology, tools, and the craft of modern work.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="about-content">
      <h2>Hello, I'm Paul</h2>
      <p>
        I am Paul Alvarez — a father, a husband, and a lover of technology. Writing is a lifelong passion that I continue to explore, refine, and share through this website.
      </p>

      <h2>About Alvalog</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Alvalog</strong> is my personal publication. It is a home for essays, in-depth hardware and software reviews, workflow breakdowns, and reflections on everyday tools.
      </p>
      <p>
        Much of the technology writing here previously lived under the banner of <em>Techuisite</em> (a synthesis of <em>Technology</em> and <em>Requisite</em>). While technology remains central to my writing, Alvalog broadens the lens to include everything that inspires me — from analog notebooks and e-ink tablets (like the Supernote and reMarkable) to personal productivity, EDC gear, and life musings.
      </p>

      <h2>Colophon</h2>
      <p>
        This site is crafted with simplicity, longevity, and reader focus in mind:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Static Engine:</strong> Built with <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Astro</a> for instant page loads and zero unnecessary JavaScript.</li>
        <li><strong>Hosting:</strong> Deployed via GitHub Pages at <a href="https://alvalog.net">alvalog.net</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Typography:</strong> Set in <em>Newsreader</em> for editorial serif headings and clean, high-legibility system sans for long-form reading comfort.</li>
        <li><strong>Color Palette:</strong> Inspired by warm newspaper stock and terracotta accents, paired with a rich slate dark mode.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Connect</h2>
      <p>
        I love connecting with fellow writers, tech enthusiasts, and curious thinkers. You can find me here:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Mastodon:</strong> <a href="https://mastodon.social/@PaulAlvarez" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">@PaulAlvarez@mastodon.social</a></li>
        <li><strong>Threads:</strong> <a href="https://www.threads.net/@techuisite" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@techuisite</a></li>
        <li><strong>GitHub:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/techuisite" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/techuisite</a></li>
        <li><strong>RSS Feed:</strong> <a href="/rss.xml">Subscribe via RSS</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-title {
    font-size: 2.75rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .about-lead {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-content {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .about-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    margin-top: 2.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .about-content ul {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .about-content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
</style>
